<div class="rich-v2 classic no-sidebar clearfix" data-module="article-rich" data-title="Baseball Camps/Tournaments" data-url="/camps/bsb/camps-tournaments">



      <h1 class="article-title">Baseball Camps/Tournaments</h1>
  



<div class="article-body clearfix">

	




<div class="article-text">



<h1>Allen Baseball Showcase</h1>
<p><img src="/camps/bsb/jjjjjjj_copy.jpg?max_height=227&amp;max_width=453" alt="" width="453" height="227">
</p>
<h3>Register Now:&nbsp;<a href="https://secure.qgiv.com/event/allensummerkidsbaseballcamp/">https://secure.qgiv.com/event<em>allensummerkidsbaseballcamp</em></a></h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>On June 23, 24, and 25&nbsp;we will be hosting our Allen Summer Kids Camp for ages 8 to 13. The camp will be run by Allen Baseball players and staff and is designed to help young players build confidence and improve their overall game heading into their season.&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Each day will focus on a different area of development:</strong></span><br>

 &bull; Day 1, Pitching and Defense<br>

 &bull; Day 2, Hitting and Baserunning<br>

 &bull; Day 3, Combining everything through competition and gameplay</p>
<p><span style="box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Pricing options:</strong></span><br>

 &bull; 3 Day Camp Package: $100<br>

 &bull; Individual Day Drop In: $50</p>
<p>Spots will fill quickly, so be sure to secure yours. Let&rsquo;s get better together.</p>



<div class="article-footer clearfix"></div>


</div>


</div> 




